 "summary": "A third-generation N-channel enhancement power MOSFET rated 400 V from drain to source and 10 A continuous with the case at 25 °C, housed in the through-hole TO-220AB. With 10 V on the gate its on-resistance is at most 0.55 Ω, and full gate charge is at most 63 nC. It carries single-pulse and repetitive avalanche ratings and a dV/dt rating for body-diode recovery, and dissipates up to 125 W with the case held at 25 °C.",
